      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "<p>\u00a0</p>\n\n<ol><li>D\u0101r b. Pin\u1e25as:</li>\n<li>The daughter of al-\u1e24amishsh\u012b, 3.</li>\n<li>Shirkat al-Q\u0101\u1e0d\u012b:</li>\n<li>The mother of \u1e24uwayt, 1. The mother of (A)b\u016b\u02bel-\u02bfIzz, 1\u00bd,</li>\n<li>Shirkat (A)b\u016b Man\u1e63\u016br, 2\u00bd,</li>\n<li>Shirkat b. \u02bfAlam al-Dawla, 1.</li>\n<li>D\u0101r \u02bfAbla, 2\u00bd,</li>\n<li>D\u0101r al-Zajj\u0101j:</li>\n<li>Sulaym\u0101n, 5. (A)b\u016b Mu\u1e25ammad, 2.</li>\n<li>(A)b\u016b\u02bel-\u1e24asan, 2. The funduq, 40.</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b\u02bel-Sur\u016br, for the q\u0101\u02bfa, 5.</li>\n<li>(Total), 171. Owed by him,</li>\n<li>207.</li>\n<li>Total,</li>\n<li>378.</li>\n<li>Spent of it:</li>\n<li>For nightwatch, Dh\u016b\u02bel-\u1e25ijja, 20.</li>\n<li>The remainder of the \u1e25ikr, Dh\u016b\u02bel-\u1e25ijja, 5\u00bc,</li>\n<li>Nightwatch for al-Jaz\u012bra, 1.</li>\n<li>A tip on account of a wall in D\u0101r</li>\n<li>al-Zajj\u0101j, 4.</li>\n<li>\u1e6c\u0101hir, for 3 weeks, 3.</li>\n<li>For zab\u012bb for the havd\u0101l\u0101, 1.</li>\n<li>Removal of garbage from D\u0101r al-Zayt, 5.</li>\n<li>Collection (fees), 15.</li>\n<li>Paid to myself, for Av, 30.</li></ol>\n\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
